  gateId: S09_PlaceAmmeter
  description: "Panel: 'Select the ammeter.' then 'Click the highlighted position
    to place it.' (tap the meter, tap the glowing slot; or drag it there). Snaps
    with a placement sound; the series path lights, the X \u2192 Y pulse runs, the
    board's A lights. AutoPlace / autoAnswer fly it in."
  lines: []
